# Split on a Bezier and a Cornu, Parallel on a Bezier, a Cornu and an
# easement (JOINT), each with Undo: SplitBezier(), SplitCornu() and
# MakeParallelBezier/Cornu/Joint() had no test. Split refuses an easement
# (CmdSplitTrack() needs Q_MODIFY_CAN_SPLIT): SplitJoint() runs only when
# something else splits one, such as a turnout placed on it.
# The parallel Bezier's far end lands on the open end of T4, so Parallel has
# to connect them: MakeParallelBezier() gave a control point as that end.
VERSION 13 5.4.0
DEMOINIT
ROOMSIZE 60.000000 x 40.000000
